IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-KVCOMP-QUANT.

DATA DIVISION.
01 DIM-D               PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 RESIDUAL-RANK       PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 COMPRESSION-X10     PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 FIDELITY-PCT        PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-KVCOMP.
    IF DIM-D == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    IF RESIDUAL-RANK == 0
        MOVE 8 TO RESIDUAL-RANK.
    END-IF.

    MOVE DIM-D TO COMPRESSION-X10.
    MULTIPLY 10 BY COMPRESSION-X10.
    MOVE RESIDUAL-RANK TO FIDELITY-PCT.
    MULTIPLY 2 BY FIDELITY-PCT.
    DIVIDE FIDELITY-PCT INTO COMPRESSION-X10.
    MOVE 99 TO FIDELITY-PCT.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 COMPRESSION-X10.
    WEIGHT 30 FIDELITY-PCT.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
